From 132b1711a8f89e7c2d174c93573bf39706870152 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 21:40:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Price the engine's two call entries against each other, which
 unblocks item 4-5
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

4-4 named this as the first thing 4-5 should do and it was never done. 4-5's
component pass priced the prologue by replicating its mechanisms locally — five
nested `using`s, a try/catch/finally, a delegate invoke — and they summed to
about 10 ns of a ~147 ns call, from which the item concluded that ~85% of a
call's fixed cost is "unattributable from outside the engine" and blocked itself
on a sampling profiler this container does not have.

A replica prices the mechanism and says nothing about what the engine's own
scopes do inside themselves. JSFunction.InvokeCallback is the engine's own short
path — the same delegate selection and `this` coercion, one `using` scope instead
of five, and none of the executing-function or legacy-caller bookkeeping — so the
difference between the two entries is that bookkeeping as the engine actually
performs it. It is a natural ablation that has been shipping the whole time.

On the same callee with the same prebuilt arguments: InvokeFunction 114.60 ns,
InvokeCallback 64.43 ns, a difference of 50.18 ns and a ratio of 0.562x, with
spreads of 12.5% and 5.4%. So 44% of a call entry is bookkeeping, not ~10 ns of
it, and the item is not blocked on a tool.

Over the twelve suites that run, 50.18 ns on 59 372 476 invocations is 2 979 ms
of a 104 620 ms driver — 2.85%, larger than 4-4's entire ceiling of 2.43% and
needing no speculation, no guard, no tier and no fallback path.

The gap is a lower bound in both directions that matter: the short arm also pays
the reflection delegate dispatch (0.68 ns, already priced) and a tail-call type
test the long path handles in its own loop, so both make it look smaller. Neither
entry allocates, so the 32 B per argument the call sites pay is outside this
measurement by construction.

Reached by a delegate bound once through reflection, so no engine change is
needed and nothing that ships is touched. Both arms are asserted to return the
same answer before anything is timed, because a short path that silently returned
early would look exactly like the finding this exists to produce. Round-robin
with the arms reversed on alternate rounds and ratioed within each round, which
is the harness 0107 had to adopt.
